aboonni si haa jajatan;","poem":1},{"text":"saboonni hundii si haa jajatan.","poem":2}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"Lafti midhaan kenniteerti;","poem":1},{"text":"Waaqayyo Waaqni keenyas nu eebbiseera.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"Waaqni nu eebbiseera;","poem":1},{"text":"handaarri lafaa hundi isa haa sodaatu.","poem":2}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/gaz_bib/PSA/67.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/gaz_bib/PSA/68.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/gaz_bib/PSA/66.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":7}